 /*
+ * The GX domain is normally owned by the GMU: a6xx_gmu_sptprac_enable() keeps
+ * GX powered through A6XX_GMU_GX_SPTPRAC_POWER_CONTROL and a6xx reads the
+ * result back from SPTPRAC_PWR_CLK_STATUS. With the GMU still in reset these
+ * registers are read-only, but they say whether hardware considers GX (and its
+ * clock) on, which is what the gfx3d RCG root is waiting for.
